      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "fc3664e07c61870fb781eddc16314e62e9cce5926d389c2a200bd5dc462f3e9a:000002_1508398582307576818:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ナルケパフネ達に招待状を渡した後、\n主人公たちはニーサを追いかけて雪山の奥に向かっていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "45b92a7c8f6790ec1ed6cadf84905d7e4240942a838fb53f48629b2f4a2dfb44",
